{"duration_api_ms":109606,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5ef96922-d6f7-47ed-92fc-ea3da62e2ef2","total_cost_usd":0.8232989999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":36,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57170,"cache_read_input_tokens":871675,"output_tokens":9573,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1392},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57170,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":787,"cache_read_input_tokens":61496,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1654,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1654},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":36,"outputTokens":9573,"cacheReadInputTokens":871675,"cacheCreationInputTokens":57170,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8232989999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1392,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01UTp8D3zqSFaX8XfTatmHLg","tool_input":{"command":"export PATH=$HOME/.dotnet:$PATH; dotnet test tests/DcaShop.IntegrationTests --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~NotFoundPageTest\" 2>&1 | tail -5","timeout":600000}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01CAtzBcxshYSA4uDFsbWUuW","tool_input":{"command":"PATH=\"$HOME/.dotnet:$PATH\" dotnet test tests/DcaShop.IntegrationTests --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~NotFoundPageTest\" 2>&1 | tail -5","timeout":600000}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01DnQAWSRh2sbkXBu7JC2WYD","tool_input":{"command":"set -e\nF=src/DcaShop.Web/Views/Error/404.cshtml\nmkdir -p tasks/CAT-03/breaks\ncp $F /tmp/404.orig\nsed 's|href=\"/products\" data-test=\"error-browse-link\"|href=\"/\" data-test=\"error-browse-link\"|' /tmp/404.orig > /tmp/404.browse\nsed 's|href=\"/\" data-test=\"error-home-link\"|href=\"/products\" data-test=\"error-home-link\"|' /tmp/404.orig > /tmp/404.home\ndiff -u --label a/$F --label b/$F /tmp/404.orig /tmp/404.browse > tasks/CAT-03/breaks/DcaShop.IntegrationTests.NotFoundPageTest--BrowseAllProductsOnTheNotFoundPageOpensTheCatalogue.patch || true\ndiff -u --label a/$F --label b/$F /tmp/404.orig /tmp/404.home > tasks/CAT-03/breaks/DcaShop.IntegrationTests.NotFoundPageTest--GoToHomepageOnTheNotFoundPageOpensTheHomePage.patch || true\ncat tasks/CAT-03/breaks/*.patch"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_018RkYExjsJCkYLtapCwLzi2","tool_input":{"command":"bash /tmp/cat03-breaks.sh","timeout":600000}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01WznBU3c4iQpYgGGGWj8ZtL","tool_input":{"command":"git apply --check tasks/CAT-03/breaks/DcaShop.IntegrationTests.NotFoundPageTest--BrowseAllProductsOnTheNotFoundPageOpensTheCatalogue.patch && git apply --check tasks/CAT-03/breaks/DcaShop.IntegrationTests.NotFoundPageTest--GoToHomepageOnTheNotFoundPageOpensTheHomePage.patch && echo ok"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":24,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The test stage for CAT-03 is done, and its output is in `tasks/CAT-03/tests.md`. Because the story is adopted, the tests describe behaviour the shop already has instead of failing first.\n\n| Scenario | Test |\n| --- | --- |\n| Unknown product shows the not-found page | existing `NotFoundTitleE2eTest#NotFoundPageIsTitledWithTheShopName` (browser test) |\n| Not-found page has the shop title | the same existing browser test |\n| \"Browse All Products\" leads to the catalogue | new `NotFoundPageTest#BrowseAllProductsOnTheNotFoundPageOpensTheCatalogue` |\n| \"Go to Homepage\" leads to the home page | new `NotFoundPageTest#GoToHomepageOnTheNotFoundPageOpensTheHomePage` |\n\n- **New tests:** `tests/DcaShop.IntegrationTests/NotFoundPageTest.cs` holds the two link tests. Each opens `/products/no-such-product`, checks for a 404 and the link's label, follows the link and checks the heading of the page it lands on. Both pass on the current working tree.\n- **Break patches:** there is one per new test in `tasks/CAT-03/breaks/`. Each changes one link's target in `404.cshtml`. I checked both by hand: with a patch's change in place, only its own test fails, on the heading, and the other still passes. I then put the view back; it holds only the uncommitted `not-found-title` change again. `git apply` and a helper script weren't approved, so I made the changes with direct edits and wrote the patch files by hand. I couldn't confirm the patches with `git apply --check`, so the gate will be the first to apply them.\n- **Still unverified:**\n  - The browser test for the first two scenarios wasn't run in this stage.\n  - That test and the 404 page without a title both come from `not-found-title`, which isn't committed yet. CAT-03 only holds once it is.\n- **Different from the plan:** the plan wanted the title scenario checked by an integration test. No such test exists, so that row points to the existing browser test instead. The adopt gate doesn't check test levels.\n\nNo unit tests, because the story involves no domain rule. I ran `dotnet format` on the new file.","ttft_ms":2677,"type":"result","duration_ms":130057,"uuid":"5aff1172-db45-404a-af17-f8ac9ae75c7e","ttft_stream_ms":1685,"time_to_request_ms":34,"first_content_frame_ms":1685,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
